cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QuizWrangler: an AI skill for converting question documents into D2L Brightspace's CSV import format"
message: "If you use this skill or adapt it for your institution, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Velthuis
    given-names: Raisa
    affiliation: Villanova University
repository-code: "https://github.com/velthuis/quizwrangler"
abstract: >-
  An AI skill that converts unstructured instructor question documents into
  D2L Brightspace's CSV import format, covering multiple choice, true/false,
  written response, short answer, multi-select, matching, and ordering.
  Question types the CSV format cannot represent are flagged with a spec for
  manual entry in Brightspace's question editor. Includes a validator that
  checks the generated file before upload. Developed for the VITAL Teaching
  and Learning Strategies Program at Villanova University.
keywords:
  - Brightspace
  - D2L
  - assessment
  - educational technology
  - large language models
  - faculty development
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-07-24"
version: "1.0.0"
